Name note: «Фагот» (Fagot) is the real-world Soviet AT-4 ATGM family nickname (also the musical instrument "bassoon"); Chinese rendering: 法戈特M2. Not affiliated with Cats Who Play or Slitherine. TERMINATOR and related marks belong to their respective owners. Source & docs: [url=https://github.com/Aleksandr-RY/fagot-m2-defiance]GitHub — fagot-m2-defiance[/url].
